<script data-page="app" type="application/json">{"component":"flashcards\/study","props":{"errors":{},"name":"Topwords","auth":{"user":{"id":5,"name":"\u00c1rp\u00e1d Szaniszl\u00f3","email":"developedbybarley@gmail.com","email_verified_at":null,"two_factor_confirmed_at":null,"streak":3,"quiz_completions":1,"text_analyses":14,"last_activity_date":"2026-05-28T00:00:00.000000Z","onboarding_completed_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:25.000000Z","created_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-05-28T11:48:13.000000Z","stripe_id":"cus_UR8u0ziMkWwJIo","pm_type":null,"pm_last_four":null,"trial_ends_at":null,"ai_access":false,"subscriptions":[]},"isAdmin":true,"subscription":{"hasActiveAccess":true,"isSubscribed":false,"isPremium":false,"hasAiAccess":false,"isOnTrial":false}},"sidebarOpen":true,"flash":{"streakTriggered":null,"success":null,"achievements":[],"calibrationPrompt":null,"showTour":false,"importedCardId":null},"deck":{"id":34,"name":"April"},"cards":[{"id":51167,"front":"<p>The company managed to ________ its competitors. (lehagyni \/ t\u00falsz\u00e1rnyalni)<\/p><p>Technology is ________ our ability to regulate it. (gyorsabban fejl\u0151dik mint\u2026)<\/p><p>He quickly ________ the others in the race. (lehagyta)<\/p><p>Demand is ________ supply. (meghaladja \/ gyorsabban n\u0151 mint)<\/p><p>lehagyni \/ t\u00falsz\u00e1rnyalni \/ gyorsabban haladni<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU)lemaradni \/ elmaradni<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ___ someone\/something = lehagyni\ud83d\udc49 ___ competitors \/ growth \/ demand\ud83d\udc49 gyakori \u00fczleti \u00e9s tech kontextusban\ud83d\udc49 \u201cout-\u201d = t\u00f6bbet \/ jobban \/ gyorsabban<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>verb: outpace<\/p><p>past: outpaced<\/p><p>past participle: outpaced<\/p><p>3rd person: outpaces<\/p><p>negative: lag behind \/ fall behind<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":1,"lapses":1,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-02","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-27T20:26:18+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-26T09:25:44+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":185,"repetitions":1,"lapses":1,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-02","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"3 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-01T21:29:39+00:00"},{"id":51219,"front":"<p>The faster car managed to _______ the slower one on the highway. (el\u0151z \/ lek\u00f6r\u00f6z)<\/p><p>She was determined to _______ her competitors in the race. (fel\u00fclm\u00fal \/ legy\u0151z)<\/p><p>The company hopes to _______ its rivals in market share next year. (megel\u0151z \/ fel\u00fclm\u00fal)<\/p><p>The new technology is expected to _______ the old methods. (elavultt\u00e1 tesz \/ fel\u00fclm\u00fal)<\/p><p>el\u0151z \/ lek\u00f6r\u00f6z \/ megel\u0151z \/ fel\u00fclm\u00fal \/ utol\u00e9r<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): lemarad \/ h\u00e1tr\u00e1ltat \/ lass\u00edt<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a car = aut\u00f3t megel\u0151zni (pl. He tried to overtake a car.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the competition = lek\u00f6r\u00f6zni a versenyt\u00e1rsakat (pl. Our goal is to overtake the competition.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a lead = el\u0151nyt szerezni (pl. The team managed to overtake a significant lead.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ someone in a race = valakit megel\u0151zni egy versenyben (pl. She was able to overtake him in the final lap.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: overtaking<\/p><p>verb: overtake<\/p><p>common pair: overtake a car \/ overtake the competition \/ overtake a lead \/ overtake in a race<\/p><p>similar: surpass \/ outstrip \/ outdo \/ get ahead of<\/p><p>negative: fall behind \/ lag \/ be overtaken<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"ease_factor":235,"repetitions":2,"lapses":3,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-02","reviewed_on":"2026-05-25","due_at":"2026-05-27T21:27:19+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-05-21T11:29:09+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":3,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-02","reviewed_on":"2026-05-20"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"5 nap","easy":"6 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-30T18:05:15+00:00"},{"id":51237,"front":"<p>Our team fought hard, but in the end, they suffered a crushing _______. <em>(veres\u00e9g \/ buk\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The general was determined to avoid a military _______ at all costs. <em>(veres\u00e9g \/ kudarc)<\/em><\/p><p>The study analyzed the factors that contribute to the _______ of democratic movements. <em>(buk\u00e1s \/ elbuk\u00e1s \/ cs\u0151d)<\/em><\/p><p>He felt a profound sense of _______ as he watched his dreams crumble. <em>(csal\u00f3d\u00e1s \/ veres\u00e9g \/ megsemmis\u00fcl\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">veres\u00e9g \/ buk\u00e1s \/ kudarc \/ cs\u0151d \/ elbuk\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): gy\u0151zelem \/ siker \/ diadal<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 suffer a _______ = elszenvedni egy veres\u00e9get (pl. The team suffered a _______ in the final match.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 avoid _______ = elker\u00fclni a veres\u00e9get (pl. The politician tried to avoid _______ by compromising.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a crushing _______ = egy megsemmis\u00edt\u0151 veres\u00e9g (pl. It was a crushing _______ for the underdog.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ in battle = veres\u00e9g a csat\u00e1ban (pl. The army faced _______ in battle.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>defeat<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>defeat<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>defeat<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: suffer defeat \/ avoid defeat \/ crushing defeat \/ ignominious defeat<\/span><\/p><p>similar: loss \/ failure \/ beaten \/ overcome<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: victory \/ win \/ triumph<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":3,"lapses":1,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-04-28","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-27T20:26:12+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-26T09:25:37+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":215,"repetitions":3,"lapses":1,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-04-28","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"3 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-03T07:44:59+00:00"},{"id":51182,"front":"<p>The artist was ________ed to paint a portrait of the mayor. (megb\u00edz \/ felk\u00e9r)<\/p><p>He earns a small ________ on every sale he makes. (jutal\u00e9k \/ prov\u00edzi\u00f3)<\/p><p>The government set up a ________ to investigate the scandal. (bizotts\u00e1g \/ vizsg\u00e1l\u00f3bizotts\u00e1g)<\/p><p>She received a ________ to compose music for the new film. (megb\u00edz\u00e1s \/ felk\u00e9r\u00e9s)<\/p><p>megb\u00edz \/ jutal\u00e9k \/ bizotts\u00e1g \/ megb\u00edz\u00e1s \/ felk\u00e9r\u00e9s<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): visszautas\u00edt \/ elutas\u00edt \/ fix fizet\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ sb to do sth = megb\u00edz valakit valamivel<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (noun) = jutal\u00e9k \/ megb\u00edz\u00e1s \/ bizotts\u00e1g \/ katonai rang<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 out of ________ = nem m\u0171k\u00f6dik \/ \u00fczemen k\u00edv\u00fcl<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 European ________ = Eur\u00f3pai Bizotts\u00e1g<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________er = biztos \/ megb\u00edz\u00f3<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: commission<\/p><p>verb: commission<\/p><p>past tense \/ -ing form: commissioned \/ commissioning<\/p><p>noun: commissioner<\/p><p>common pair: sales commission \/ out of commission \/ commission a work \/ European Commission<\/p><p>similar: order \/ assignment \/ fee \/ committee \/ instruct<\/p><p>negative: reject \/ refuse \/ salary \/ fixed pay<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":3,"lapses":1,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-02","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-27T20:26:00+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-26T09:25:40+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":215,"repetitions":3,"lapses":1,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-02","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"3 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-01T21:28:48+00:00"},{"id":51245,"front":"<p>The teacher gave us an _______ of our progress at the end of the semester. <em>(\u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9s \/ felm\u00e9r\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>A thorough risk _______ is crucial before launching a new product. <em>(felm\u00e9r\u00e9s \/ \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>The _______ of the patient&#039;s condition revealed a need for immediate surgery. <em>(\u00e1llapotfelm\u00e9r\u00e9s \/ diagn\u00f3zis)<\/em><\/p><p>Her _______ of the situation was remarkably accurate, predicting the outcome with precision. <em>(\u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9se \/ felm\u00e9r\u00e9se)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9s \/ felm\u00e9r\u00e9s \/ m\u00e9rlegel\u00e9s \/ becsl\u00e9s \/ diagn\u00f3zis<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elhanyagol\u00e1s \/ figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy\u00e1s \/ megtagad\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 perform an _______ = v\u00e9gezni egy \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9st\/felm\u00e9r\u00e9st (pl. The company will perform an _______ of its financial performance.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 conduct an _______ = lefolytatni egy \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9st\/felm\u00e9r\u00e9st (pl. The committee will conduct an _______ of the proposals.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 formal _______ = hivatalos \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9s\/felm\u00e9r\u00e9s (pl. The _______ is required for all employees.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 self _______ = \u00f6n\u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9s (pl. She completed a self _______ of her strengths and weaknesses.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 peer _______ = szak\u00e9rt\u0151i \u00e9rt\u00e9kel\u00e9s (pl. The research paper underwent peer _______ before publication.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>assessment<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>assessment<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>assess<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: performance assessment \/ risk assessment \/ needs assessment \/ initial assessment<\/span><\/p><p>similar: evaluation \/ appraisal \/ judgment \/ estimation<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: neglect \/ ignorance \/ disregard<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":1,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":3,"lapses":1,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-04-29","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26","due_at":"2026-05-27T20:26:27+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-05-26T09:25:20+00:00","interval":1,"ease_factor":215,"repetitions":3,"lapses":1,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-04-29","reviewed_on":"2026-05-26"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"3 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-10T21:30:57+00:00"},{"id":51176,"front":"<p>The boat was ________ed by the waves during the storm. (ringat \/ himb\u00e1l)<\/p><p>She sat on a large ________ by the edge of the water. (szikla \/ k\u0151)<\/p><p>The scandal ________ed the entire company to its foundations. (megrengett \/ megr\u00e1z)<\/p><p>He has been her ________ throughout all the difficult times. (t\u00e1masza \/ szikl\u00e1ja)<\/p><p>szikla \/ k\u0151 \/ ringat \/ megrengett \/ t\u00e1masza<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): stabil \/ mozdulatlan \/ homok \/ puha talaj<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (noun) = szikla \/ k\u0151 \/ t\u00e1masz (\u00e1tvitt) \/ rock zene<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (verb) = ringat \/ meghimb\u00e1l \/ megr\u00e1z<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 on the ________s = bajban van \/ cs\u0151dben \/ j\u00e9ggel (ital)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ bottom = m\u00e9lypontja valaminek<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 be between a ________ and a hard place = k\u00e9t t\u0171z k\u00f6z\u00f6tt van<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: rock<\/p><p>verb: rock<\/p><p>past tense \/ -ing form: rocked \/ rocking<\/p><p>adjective: rocky<\/p><p>common pair: rock bottom \/ on the rocks \/ rock music \/ rock the boat \/ solid as a rock<\/p><p>similar: stone \/ boulder \/ shake \/ disturb \/ pillar<\/p><p>negative: sand \/ unstable \/ soft ground \/ smooth<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":12,"ease_factor":235,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-04-29","reviewed_on":"2026-05-15","due_at":"2026-05-27T21:22:05+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-05-13T20:58:33+00:00","interval":10,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_