/ speak on behalf<\/span><\/p><p>similar: representation \/ proxy \/ stead \/ name<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: individually \/ personally \/ independently<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"behalf","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":11,"ease_factor":220,"repetitions":3,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-04-28","reviewed_on":"2026-05-16","due_at":"2026-05-27T17:02:31+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"review","due_at":"2026-05-16T16:24:30+00:00","interval":5,"ease_factor":220,"repetitions":2,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-04-28","reviewed_on":"2026-05-11"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"13 nap","good":"24 nap","easy":"31 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-31T14:59:56+00:00"},{"id":51234,"front":"<p>My head started to _______ after staring at the computer screen for too long. <em>(f\u00e1j \/ viszket)<\/em><\/p><p>The patient reported a dull _______ in his lower back that had persisted for weeks. <em>(f\u00e1jdalom \/ sz\u00far\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The constant noise from the construction site began to _______ at his nerves. <em>(ideges\u00edt \/ gy\u00f6t\u00f6r)<\/em><\/p><p>She felt a sharp _______ of regret when she realized her mistake. <em>(sz\u00far\u00e1s \/ cs\u00edp\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 197, 94);\">f\u00e1j \/ f\u00e1jdalom  \/ sz\u00far\u00e1s \/ cs\u00edp\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p><span>Negative meaning (HU): j\u00f3lesik \/ k\u00f6nny\u0171 \/ f\u00e1jdalommentes<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ in my _______ = f\u00e1jdalom valahol (pl. I have an _______ in my _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ all _______ = teljesen f\u00e1jdalommentes (pl. The procedure was _______ _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ _______ = fejf\u00e1j\u00e1s (pl. I've got a terrible _______ _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ______